flowchart TD
  accTitle: Barriers
  accDescr: A new referral with no transport goes on the Transport screen. Barriers open from the Patients screen, or when the family tells the family assistant about a money, transport or childcare problem. A transport barrier is closed by sending a van and reopens if the ride fails. Any barrier can also be closed by the coordinator with a note saying how it was solved.
  A["New referral with no transport"] --> T["Goes on the Transport screen"]
  T --> D["Choose a free van and send it"]
  B["Patients: Raise barrier or Log contact"] --> O["Barrier is open"]
  FA["Family assistant reports a problem<br/>raised by family"] --> O
  O --> Q{"What kind?"}
  Q -->|Transport| D
  D --> R["Barrier closes automatically"]
  R --> P{"Ride fails?"}
  P -->|Yes| O
  P -->|No| Z["Patient reaches a hospital"]
  Q -->|"Any kind"| X["Coordinator closes it with a note"]
